  "description": "NNModbus is a high-performance C# / .NET implementation of the Modbus protocol with built-in typed data extensions (ReadInt16, ReadInt32, ReadFloat, ReadDouble, ReadString, ReadBool, etc.), HslCommunication-style safe return (ModbusResult), and endianness formatting across TCP, UDP, RTU, and ASCII.",
  "frameworkAssemblyGroup": {
    "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.10.27.13.57.06/nnmodbus.0.6.1.json#frameworkassemblygroup/.netframework4.6",
