  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.6.1:\n- Added V2 HslCommunication-style methods (Read*V2 and Write*V2 with ModbusResult<T> / ModbusResult).\n- Built-in typed data extensions for Bool, Int16, UInt16, Int32, UInt32, Int64, UInt64, Float (IEEE 754), Double, and String.\n- Fixed string handling for empty/null strings and null-terminator trimming in PLC buffers.\n- Support for EndianFormat (ABCD, CDAB, BADC, DCBA).",
